   Powell W. A., 2018, GSFCE- DAATN62651.
   SiFive Inc, 2021, SI5 U74 COR COMPL MA.
   Wilson AE, 2021, 2021 IEEE SPACE COMPUTING CONFERENCE (SCC), P1, DOI 10.1109/SCC49971.2021.00008.},
