   Hennessy JL, 2019, COMMUN ACM, V62, P48, DOI 10.1145/3282307.
   Lee Y, 2016, IEEE MICRO, V36, P8, DOI 10.1109/MM.2016.11.},
Number-of-Cited-References = {4},
