   Univ Carlos III Madrid, Madrid, SPAIN, JUN 19-23, 2023},
Abstract = {Edge to Cloud Continuum is a concept that integrates cloud computing and
   cellular networks that has been gaining popularity due to its potential
   to provide a seamless user experience and address the challenges of
   managing complex multi-domain networks involving massive IoT devices.
   Enabling intelligence in the Edge to Cloud Continuum can further enhance
   its capabilities, offering benefits such as reduced latency, improved
   scalability, enhanced resource utilization, and increased context
   awareness. This paper provides insights into the opportunities and
   challenges of enabling intelligence in Edge to Cloud Continuum,
   highlighting the potential of this technology. This study presents a
   comprehensive review of the existing literature on enabling intelligence
   in Edge to Cloud Continuum, to reach the research questions that will
   construct the PhD. Various tools and technologies that can be used to
   integrate intelligence into the Edge to Cloud Continuum system were
   explored and analyzed. In addition, this study provides a detailed work
   plan for the upcoming months of the project.},
