   open-source hardware, secure, and high-performance processor core based
   on the RISC-V ISA. The originality of the approach lies in the
   integration of a complete solution to increase security based on dynamic
   code transformation, covering 4 of the 5 NIST1 functions of
   cybersecurity via monitoring (identify, detect), obfuscation (protect),
   and dynamic adaptation (react).},
