   EDUCATION, VOL 2, SIGCSE 2023},
Year = {2023},
Pages = {1396},
Note = {54th Annual ACM SIGCSE Technical Symposium on Computer Science Education
   (SIGCSE TS), Toronto, CANADA, MAR 15-18, 2023},
Abstract = {rvcodec.js is an open-source, online RISC-V instruction encoder-decoder,
   specifically geared towards students learning about instruction formats.
   For improved usability, rvcodec.js uses bright colors to visually map
   the relationships between the instruction's assembly tokens and binary
   fields. Students can, for example, quickly identify which bits in the
   binary representation correspond to a certain immediate value in the
   assembly instruction.
   rvcodec.js is available at https://luplab.gitlab.io/rvcodecjs/.},
