   Antwerp, BELGIUM, APR 17-19, 2023},
Abstract = {In this paper, we present a novel approach for design understanding of
   processors. Our approach uses clustering techniques to identify datapath
   similarities based on control signal vectors. The resulting dendrogram
   captures the closeness of instructions wrt. their datapath and control
   in visual form. We demonstrate how our approach helps in design
   understanding of a RISC-V processor without reading the HDL code.},
