   technology gaps to achieve high performance while remaining under tight
   power constraints: energy efficiency and thermal control; extreme
   computation efficiency via HW acceleration and new arithmetic; methods
   and tools for seamless integration of reconfigurable accelerators in
   heterogeneous HPC multi-node platforms. TEXTAROSSA addresses these gaps
   through a co -design approach to heterogeneous HPC solutions, supported
   by the integration and extension of HW and SW IPs, programming models,
   and tools derived from European research.},
